              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mein Onkel ist der Pate meiner Tochter. My uncle is my daughter's godfather."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Weak noun: den Paten. A godmother is die Patin or die Patentante."
            }
          ]
        },
